                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "The game might not have been all that bad, were it not for the countless bugs. I just don't understand how there can be so many of them in such a small game. From items disappearing from the inventory to the most infuriating thing of all the issue is that it can freeze at any moment whether during the opponent's turn or even after the battle has already ended At any moment it can stop responding to button presses, including the esc key, ultimately, the only way to exit it will be by pressing Alt+F4 and every battle in which this happened will have to be replayed from scratch",
